    "detailed_description": "Retailer Tycoon is a base building game that incorporates all types of retailer shops from general stores to wholesale stores. The aim of this game is to become the biggest and most wealthy retailer store chain possible that\u2019s based across Sydney Australia. <br><br>In Retailer Tycoon you are able to begin your store (any type of store) from limited funds (based on the game mode) and grow your store, enter new and exciting locations, upgrade how your store is run, managing staff, open your store late for community events and so much more to explore.<br><br><strong>Start from scratch</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489340/extras/bff09f096492352c2486d2b2ad4db89a.avif?t=1611209162\" data-has-big /></div><br><br><strong>Manage your staff</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489340/extras/72c4eab6793c66c57232d9041750af53.avif?t=1611209162\" /></div><br><br><strong>Manage your store</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489340/extras/ac8808051118dbf7750b5439420fc5fe.avif?t=1611209162\" /></div><br><br><strong>Tavel to new locations</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489340/extras/461264558d89236067df467263bbb737.avif?t=1611209162\" /></div>",
